    "text": "Is HH Remodeling LLC the Right Choice for My Bathroom Fixture Installation?",
    "@type": "Question",
    "answerCount": 1,
    "acceptedAnswer": {
      "text": "Wondering if HH Remodeling LLC is the right fit for your bathroom fixture installation? Well, we specialize in making your home feel more like home, and that includes expert fixture installations. Abraham Becerra, our owner, is hands-on and oversees projects, coordinating with plumbing and electrical sub-trades while our crew handles the detailed work. So, if you're looking for a single point of contact and someone who's really invested in your project, that's us. We're a BBB Accredited Business with an A+ rating, founded in 2017, so we've got a solid track record. We tackle everything from standard home improvements to more complex renovations, and we're known for clear communication every step of the way. If you've got a heavy fixture, need code compliance checked, or just want to make sure everything lines up perfectly and is leak-free, we're definitely a great choice. We serve the greater Denver area, including Aurora, Centennial, Littleton, and many other surrounding communities. Give us a call at 303-505-0866, and let's chat about your project!",
      "@type": "Answer",
      "author": {
        "name": "HH Remodeling LLC",
        "@type": "Organization"
      }
    }
